From these results, we see that performing EMD and/or WPD often results in more informative features, as many of the top features come from these categories. Moreover, we see that the EHG signal from channel 3 is the most informative one. Nevertheless, the informativeness of the individual features is rather limited, with a maximal AUC ranging roughly between 0.60
